<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sharukan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">late 11th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/11th-century">11th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sharukan was a Cuman khan of the late 11th century, a leader of the tribes on the Donets steppe. He raided the lands of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kievan-rus">Kievan Rus'</a> and was defeated with other khans by the Rus' princes on the Sula river in 1107. A town on the Donets bore his name, and his grandson <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/konchak">Konchak</a> became one of the best-known Cuman rulers.</p></div>
